--- !u!114 &-9015823519429041701
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Archives
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: archives_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2835, y: 4195}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: 'You take the left corridor and walk down for a little while until you finally
    reach a door that is slightly open at the end of the hall. You push it open and
    slip inside.


    As soon as you enter, you see an overwhelming amount of scrolls,
    rolled maps, books, and bound records. Everything is arranged and stacked with
    obsessive care.


    You move closer to the nearest desk and unroll one of the
    documents. It looks like... family records?


    Names. Dates. Years going on
    and on, and a name that gets repeated over and over again. Damon Erythros. The
    man who conquered the island and whose family has ruled over it ever since, for
    far too long. Longer than people seem to know. Long enough that no one living
    would remember a time before them.


    You find another scroll and open it.
    Maps this time. Routes across the island. Alchemy supply routes, maybe? They
    shouldn''t know... Some of them must be incorrect, but... some others look right.
    They know where we are.'
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: archives_choices_1
