--- !u!114 &-8287876807606467316
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Archives_Look
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: archives_look_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 4470}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Next document. It speaks of the war overseas. \"...by keeping them afraid,
    they seem willing to hand over their sons and daughters for 'the cause'.\" You
    read it once more.\n\nYou're running out of time. Next one, fast. You find a
    ledger that looks more like a clinical update: \"Subjects of smaller physical
    composition demonstrate higher adaptability to initial integration. Compliance
    rates increase when introduced at earlier developmental stages.\"\n\nYou lower
    the ledger slowly. \u201CWhat the fuck is going on here?\u201D\n\nThe family
    has ruled for longer than anyone remembers. Some of the routes\u2026 they know
    them. The war\u2026 or whatever it is. And that last one... smaller bodies, earlier
    stages.\n\n\u201CWhat are they doing?\u201D"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: archives_look_choices_1
--- !u!114 &-8276472268758198158
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Start
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: start_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 2105}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You sit up and steady your breath before fully standing up from the bed.
    You move to the bathroom sink and splash water over your face. You haven't had
    a dream in a while, so it lingers for a few more moments. Why were they there?
    Serena. Strawberry.\n\nYou pause and look at yourself in the mirror. \u201CHypocrite,\u201D
    you mutter to your reflection. You know better than to dwell on something like
    this. In the end, the Gods show dreams that are only meant to trick you. Just
    a test.\n\nYou exhale sharply and compose yourself. Whatever it was, it doesn\u2019t
    matter. You have to keep yourself awake and ready for today's mission. You get
    ready after a few minutes, and just before you go, you take a vial out of your
    pouch. <i>Today I need to be at my best... should I...?</i>"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: start_choices_1
