--- !u!114 &-7517729987276351275
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lektryon_Observe
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: lektryon_observe_line
  editorPosition: {x: 1075, y: 3535}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Not yet. Just a little more. Lektryon swings again, committing his weight
    to the strike. You step aside just enough for it to miss you, but close enough
    to feel the shift in the air from the swing.\n\n<i>\u201CToo much force.\u201D</i>
    you think. <i>\u201CDesperate.\u201D</i>\n\nYou let him keep going, letting him
    tire further. <i>\u201CHe\u2019s trying to end it quickly.\u201D</i> Each strike
    grows a little heavier, a little faster, and a lot less controlled than the previous
    one. You keep your distance, meeting his blade at the right angle. Again. And
    again.\n\nUntil you see it.\n\nAs his stance opens just enough, you move in quickly.
    Your blades catch his, and you push forward, forcing him off balance. The force
    of your body drives him down beneath you. He can barely compose himself before
    your blade comes down.\n\nThe tip stops at his throat.\n\nLektryon freezes and
    breathes sharply for a second. His chest rises fast, and his eyes lock onto yours.
    You hold the position for a moment. Then you lower your blade and lean in so
    only he can hear:"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: lektryon_observe_choices_1
