  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You step out of the room, back into the corridor as the voices come closer
    to your position. You focus your vision and see two guards coming toward you,
    further down the hall. You don\u2019t have time to think. <color=#a674e8>\"They\u2019ll
    see you.\"</color> Your hand tightens slightly at your side.You step out of the
    room, back into the corridor as the voices come closer to your position. You
    focus your vision and see two guards further down the hall coming toward you.\n\nYou
    don\u2019t have time to think. <color=#a674e8>\"They\u2019ll see you.\"</color>
    Your hand tightens slightly at your side."
