      and vibrant; the sounds are clearer, and the edges are sharper.\n\nThe steam,
      the valves, the creak of metal, the cracks in the walls. You <i>feel</i> it
      all.\n<color=#a674e8>\u201CYou are ready.\u201D</color> A whisper."
