--- !u!114 &-6593925545628971887
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dreaming
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: dreaming_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 290}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: 'Darkness. Silence.


    As you open your eyes, you see the town stretching
    before you. A rotten town, engulfed by night. Lanterns hang from curved iron
    pipes, streams of steam hissing consistently, bronze pipes snake along the walls.


    Nerethos.
    A steampunk hellhole ruled by the Erythros family, where only the rotten remain.
    An island where the scum of the earth goes to be forgotten. At the entrance of
    the archipelago stands an old statue depicting Monarch Helian The former monarch
    of Nerethos, dethroned over two centuries ago. The island once thrived under
    his rule. It once was a perfect hub of life and trade. Since Damon Erythros conquered
    it, nothing has been the same.

    , now crumbling apart. It has been centuries
    since the conquest, and ever since then, the island has been declining. Or so
    you have heard.


    You turn around and see a cobblestone path inviting you
    towards the port.'
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: dreaming_choices_1
