--- !u!114 &-6395388147478376933
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Strawberry_Press2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: strawberry_press2_line
  editorPosition: {x: 965, y: 1665}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "<color=#a674e8>\u201CAre you fucking kiddin' me? What a way of victimizing
    herself!\u201D</color>\nYour fingers twitch at your side. That's it. She has
    to be making this up. She has to be waiting until you are all unprepared to destroy
    this place. That has to be it. And yet... Blueberry is calm and tender with her.
    It doesn't even pull away. That damned thing should be wild and unpredictable,
    and yet...You observe them in silence. This is wrong. Something is off. Valerian
    says the creature should be wild and unpredictable. He said it was a territorial
    beast, impossible to keep restrained.\n\nBut Blueberry... it willingly leans
    toward Strawberry. Toward her hand and her voice and her presence. She is now
    petting Blueberry again, smiling with her.You straighten and clear your throat.
    \u201CThen tell me something,\u201D you say. \u201CWhy does it listen to you?\u201D\n\nStrawberry
    looks at you, and her smile widens as her expression softens. <color=#5E9FBC>\u201CBlueberry
    is a SHE. And she doesn't listen to me! She's a dummy little girl. But I listen
    to her...\u201D</color>"
  importedSegments:
  - text: "<color=#a674e8>\u201CAre you fucking kiddin' me? What a way of victimizing
      herself!\u201D</color>\nYour fingers twitch at your side. That's it. She has
      to be making this up. She has to be waiting until you are all unprepared to
      destroy this place. That has to be it. And yet... Blueberry is calm and tender
      with her. It doesn't even pull away. That damned thing should be wild and unpredictable,
      and yet..."
    condition:
      tokens:
      - tokenType: 0
        condition:
          mode: 2
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2b5c5b2a4f8c4d219da0eec43e8017c, type: 2}
          comparison: 0
          booleanValue: 0
          integerValue: 2
          floatValue: 2
          stringValue: 2
          invert: 0
  - text: 'You observe them in silence. This is wrong. Something is off. Valerian
      says the creature should be wild and unpredictable. He said it was a territorial
      beast, impossible to keep restrained.


      But Blueberry... it willingly
      leans toward Strawberry. Toward her hand and her voice and her presence. She
      is now petting Blueberry again, smiling with her.'
