--- !u!114 &-6322878292938511303
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Castle_A
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: castle_a_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2285, y: 3920}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "A few hours have passed, and finally, the castle rises from the mist. Stone
    towers stretch upward, catching the glow of the moon.\n\nYou crouch at the top
    of the outer gates\u2019 tower. From here, you can see the gardens below. Guards.\n\nYour
    eyes move through them quickly. There's no time to understand their patterns.
    You have to go. There's no way they can catch you anyway.<color=#a674e8>\u201CThere
    she is! Look at you go!\u201D</color> A whisper slips in, always, always amused.
    <color=#a674e8>\u201CThat\u2019s better.\u201D</color> You shake it off for now,
    but you know she'll be back.Your body drops into the gardens, and the leaves
    under your boots crackle. You move immediately as guards start approaching your
    previous location.\n\nAhead, the castle walls come into view. Closer now. You
    see a balcony to the west and multiple windows to the east."
