  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Main Hall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: main_hall_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 2435}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You step into the Emerald Order's Organization led by Archon Valerian, operating
    with military-level discipline and a strict hierarchy. They position themselves
    as the only force capable of pushing back against the Erythros family\u2019s
    control over the island. They control the black market, distributing alchemy
    that can push the body beyond its limits.\nmain hall and see the space is already
    awake. Your crew is taking care of their respective tasks. You hear the bashing
    of steel against steel echoing from the training grounds, low conversations blending
    in the crowd.\n\nAround you, the walls are lined with marked maps showing multiple
    smuggling routes, connecting to different islands close to Nerethos.\n\n\"Legate\"
    A high-ranking operative, acting directly under the Archon. They operate independently,
    handling high-risk missions. Few in number, reserved for those reliable enough
    to act as direct extensions of Valerian.\nyou hear multiple times as you walk
    by, accompanied by a bow of the head. Again and again. You\u2019ve stood here
    a hundred times before. What is your next step?You step back into the main hall.\nYou\u2019ve
    stood here a hundred times before. What is your next step?"
