  editorPosition: {x: 2010, y: 1775}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Your steps echo down the stairs as you make your way to the last cell. She
    has been here for a while, and yet there have not been signs of resistance.\n\nStrawberry
    and <i>that creature.</i>\n\n\u201CDid I have them separated?\u201D You can\u2019t
    quite recall if you have given that order already..."
