--- !u!114 &-5070611601080570263
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: LektryonStart
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: lektryonstart_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2120, y: 2545}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You make your way to the Order's training grounds. You hear the rhythm of
    the clash of steel against steel echoing through the hallway before you reach
    the area.\n\nYou step in and see Centurion LektryonA commander-level officer
    in the Emerald Order. They oversee field missions and enforce the Order\u2019s
    structure. They answer to Legate and Archon ranks. Lektryon has been directly
    assigned to Facey\u2019s operations, acting as her support and direct protection.\nstanding
    at the centre of the room, cutting through fight after fight without stopping.
    You carefully observe his movements, as you have many times before.\n\nHe is...
    bigger. Not just stronger; he has always been. But heavier. Over the past few
    months, his fa\xE7ade has changed a lot. His muscles are bigger, he's faster,
    he's sharper... but sloppier.\n\nYou see the battle come to a close. Lektryon
    finishes it with a strike that knocks the other soldier back. Then he looks at
    you.\n\n<color=#DBD73C>\u201CLegate Facey,\u201D</color> he says, breathing heavily.
    He rolls his shoulders, cracks his neck, and looks at you again, expectant.\n\n<color=#DBD73C>\u201CYou
    are just in time.\u201D</color>"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: lektryonstart_choices_1
--- !u!114 &-4940693988955529676
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Alch_Go
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: alch_go_line
  editorPosition: {x: 3660, y: 6120}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "The door. You need... out. Now.\n\nYou take a few steps back, fumbling with
    your hand, trying to find the handle. Nothing. <i>What the...</i> You turn around
    and...\n\nYou\u2019re outside.\n\nYou look around you and see darkness and green.
    Some stars in the night sky illuminate the forest. You try to look for Serena.
    For the castle. Nothing.\n\n<i>\u201CI need... I need to get to town.\u201D</i>\n\n<color=#a674e8>\"M\u0334\xE3\u0337\u0177\u0336\u0253\u0337\u0119\u0334\u2026
    \u0125\u0124\u0127\u0119\u0112\u0113\u2019\u0142\u2026 \u0192\u0192\u0129\u1E8B\u0337\u0313\u0341\u033E\u033E\u0315\u0311\u034C\u0341\u0312\u031B\u0313\u035D\u2026
    \u0177\u014D\u016D\u2026\"</color> She hugs you from behind, but you don't feel
    your weight changing. She whispers more into your ear. <color=#a674e8>\"\xD8\u0337r\u0336\u2026
    m\u0334\xE3\u0337\u0177\u0336\u0253\u0337\u0119\u0334\u2026 \u0177\u014D\u016D\u2019\u0157\u0119\u2026
    \u0101\u0142\u0157\u0119\u0101\u0111\u0177\u2026 \xFE\u0119\u0157\u0192\u0119\u0107\u0167\u0337\u0313\u0341\u033E\u033E\u0315\u0311\u034C\u0341\u0312\u031B\u0313\u035D\u2026\xFE\u0119\u0157\u0192\u0119\u0107\u0167\"</color>\n\nThe
    world flickers again."
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: alch_go_choices_1
