  id: warroom_end_line
  editorPosition: {x: 3605, y: 3920}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Your gaze shifts to the surrounding documents and books. Your eyes focus
    on one of them. \u201CThe Emerald Order.\u201D You open it and see page after
    page listing the names of every member of the Order. Valerian, Lektryon. You.
    \u201CHow can they know this?\u201D\n\nYou put the book down and look around
    the room again. Nothing here speaks of another island or about the war. Everything
    here points inward, at Nerethos.<color=#a674e8>\u201CWhat does that tell ya,
    little dog?\u201D</color>Voices approach. You move immediately, slipping behind
    one of the heavy curtains on the wall. The words are muffled, but you catch fragments:\n\n\u201CIf
    you talk, he's gonna make your family pay for it.\u201D Silence.\n\n\u201C\u2026I
    know.\u201D\n\nThe footsteps fade, and once they are completely gone, you move."
  importedSegments:
  - text: "Your gaze shifts to the surrounding documents and books. Your eyes focus
      on one of them. \u201CThe Emerald Order.\u201D You open it and see page after
      page listing the names of every member of the Order. Valerian, Lektryon. You.
      \u201CHow can they know this?\u201D\n\nYou put the book down and look around
      the room again. Nothing here speaks of another island or about the war. Everything
      here points inward, at Nerethos."
    condition:
