--- !u!114 &-3642422799947466245
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Strawberry_Talk2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: strawberry_talk2_line
  editorPosition: {x: 360, y: 1830}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Strawberry looks at you for a moment, like she\u2019s trying to understand
    what you\u2019re really asking. <color=#5E9FBC>\u201CWhat do you mean? She wouldn't
    do that. She is my friend!\u201D</color> she says. <color=#5E9FBC>\u201CWe take
    care of each other.\u201D</color>\n\nWhat? You can't understand this. Valerian
    says the creature should be wild and unpredictable. He said it was a territorial
    beast, impossible to keep restrained. But Blueberry... it willingly leans toward
    Strawberry. Toward her hand and her voice and her presence. She is now petting
    Blueberry again, smiling with her.\n\nYou take a step and hold the bars with
    one hand. \u201CThat\u2019s not how this works.\u201D Your voice echoes loudly
    down the hallway, making Blueberry neigh in discomfort beside Strawberry, rustling
    her feathers and flicking her tail. You prepare your parazoniums A short, carbon
    steel blade meant for close combat, worn at the hip. Designed for a more precise
    and controlled combat style. Facey carries a pair.\n. Is it attacking?"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: strawberry_talk2_choices_1
--- !u!114 &-3616795217661163970
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: WarRoomA_Ledger
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: warrooma_ledger_line
  editorPosition: {x: 1295, y: 4140}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Your eyes move around the room quickly, trying to pick something to check.
    This damn place is infinite. You see a stack of books in a cluster across the
    table. Some are open, with pages sticking out. You reach for one of these.\n\n\"The
    Emerald Order,\" it reads. You flip it open.\n\nYour eyes move too fast to take
    any of it in, you see some familiar details. You recognize faces, names you\u2019ve
    seen, maybe even worked beside.<color=#a674e8>\"Hey, look at that, they know
    who you are...\"</color> <color=#a674e8>\"Shut the fuck up!\"</color>You turn
    another page. More of it. This is nonsense. You snap the ledger shut and drop
    it back where you found it.\n\nYou hear movement outside the room. You gotta
    go deal with that immediately."
