      to be... fair either way.\u201D</color> Her gaze drifts just slightly, then
      returns to where your eyes should be through the mask. <color=#FF675E>\u201CThe
      Gods set things in motion long before either of us had the chance to choose.\u201D</color>"
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "<color=#a674e8><i>Greater than themselves?</i></color> Eris cackles.<color=#a674e8><i>\u201CListen
      to her. Trying to pass fear as faith again... They always do!\u201D</i></color>"
