--- !u!114 &-686142743658817877
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Valerian_Entry
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: valerian_entry_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 3095}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "The door opens slowly, and Valerian steps inside.\n\nHe is larger than most
    men. Broad shoulders held straight, with a firm posture. Long, dark hair falls
    past his shoulders, streaked faintly with grey. A thick, full beard frames his
    mouth. Deep blue eyes, almost crystalline, find you before he says a word.\n\nHe
    observes you closely. The blades at your sides. The stillness in your stance.<color=#199D7C>\u201CWhat
    was that, Legate?\u201D</color> His voice fills the room, dominant. <color=#199D7C>\u201CYou
    will speak with respect.\u201D</color>\n\nValerian stops in front of you, looking
    at you directly. <color=#199D7C>\u201CI expect you to be composed. Always. There
    is no other way.\u201D</color>\n\nHe adjusts the edges of your cloak and pulls
    your hood into place. Then both of his hands land on your shoulders. <color=#199D7C>\u201CDo
    not forget what you represent.\u201D</color><color=#199D7C>\u201CYou are ready,
    Legate,\u201D</color> he says quietly, stepping closer.\n\nValerian stops in
    front of you and rests his hand firmly on your shoulder.\n\n<color=#199D7C>\u201CI
    am proud of you, Facey,\u201D</color> he says. <color=#199D7C>\u201COf how far
    you have come.\u201D</color> He then adjusts the edges of your cloak and pulls
    your hood into place. Then both of his hands land on your shoulders. You can
    feel the approval in his gesture.\n\n<color=#199D7C>\u201CYou have grown to become
    exactly what the Emerald Order needs. What humanity needs.\u201D</color>\n\nHis
    voice is stern and certain."
  importedSegments:
  - text: 'The door opens slowly, and Valerian steps inside.


      He is larger
      than most men. Broad shoulders held straight, with a firm posture. Long, dark
      hair falls past his shoulders, streaked faintly with grey. A thick, full beard
      frames his mouth. Deep blue eyes, almost crystalline, find you before he says
      a word.


      He observes you closely. The blades at your sides. The stillness
      in your stance.'
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "<color=#199D7C>\u201CWhat was that, Legate?\u201D</color> His voice fills
      the room, dominant. <color=#199D7C>\u201CYou will speak with respect.\u201D</color>\n\nValerian
      stops in front of you, looking at you directly. <color=#199D7C>\u201CI expect
      you to be composed. Always. There is no other way.\u201D</color>\n\nHe adjusts
      the edges of your cloak and pulls your hood into place. Then both of his hands
      land on your shoulders. <color=#199D7C>\u201CDo not forget what you represent.\u201D</color>"
    condition:
      tokens:
      - tokenType: 0
        condition:
          mode: 2
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2b5c5b2a4f8c4d219da0eec43e8017c, type: 2}
          comparison: 3
          booleanValue: 0
          integerValue: 2
          floatValue: 2
          stringValue: 2
          invert: 0
  - text: "<color=#199D7C>\u201CYou are ready, Legate,\u201D</color> he says quietly,
      stepping closer.\n\nValerian stops in front of you and rests his hand firmly
      on your shoulder.\n\n<color=#199D7C>\u201CI am proud of you, Facey,\u201D</color>
      he says. <color=#199D7C>\u201COf how far you have come.\u201D</color> He then
      adjusts the edges of your cloak and pulls your hood into place. Then both of
      his hands land on your shoulders. You can feel the approval in his gesture.\n\n<color=#199D7C>\u201CYou
      have grown to become exactly what the Emerald Order needs. What humanity needs.\u201D</color>\n\nHis
      voice is stern and certain."
