--- !u!114 &-135480829675988547
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Castle_HubA
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: castle_huba_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2175, y: 4470}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You grip the ledge of the window and pull yourself up, entering through
    the open window without stopping. Your boots hit the ground, and you move immediately.\n\nThe
    hallway stretches ahead. The castle looks old; the walls are made of stone, and
    there are a bunch of shitty portraits. You barely register anything around you.
    <i>Focus on the mission.</i>\n\nYou hear movement and voices ahead, but you don't
    stop. You slip between two pillars just as the guards pass your position.\n\n\"...raid...
    it was necessary.\"\n\nYou don\u2019t stay to listen. You\u2019re already moving
    ahead.<color=#a674e8>\u201CHumans worry about the most trivial things.\u201D</color>
    The voice hums, pleased. <color=#a674e8>\u201CBut you don\u2019t have time for
    that, right?\u201D</color> A soft laugh follows.You move forward, faster now,
    until the corridor opens into multiple paths. You stop.\n\nThis wasn\u2019t part
    of the blueprints.You don\u2019t have time to slow down.<color=#a674e8>\u201CStill
    with me, little dog?\u201D</color> You press your fingers against your temples
    for a second. When you lower your hand, you catch her at the corner of your eye
    again.\n\n<i>\u201CSHAKE IT OFF\u201D</i>You reach the branching corridor again.
    You don\u2019t have time to explore everything. Let\u2019s go."
