--- !u!114 &1696161531973997041
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Catacombs
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: catacombs_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2945, y: 4800}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You move deeper into the castle until you reach a corridor that tightens
    before opening into a section lined with thick stone doors that look older than
    anything around them. In front of them, two guards patrol the entrance.\n\nYou
    slip behind a nearby pillar, pressing yourself into the shadows, watching.\n\nTheir
    patrol is tighter than the others you\u2019ve seen tonight. They don\u2019t cross
    the corridor. They don\u2019t speak. They just circle the same space, back and
    forth, back and forth."
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: catacombs_choices_1
--- !u!114 &1707216763954626387
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serena_Know2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: serena_know2_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2175, y: 8375}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Serena doesn\u2019t answer right away. Instead, she studies you for a second,
    leaning even closer.\n\n\u201C\u2026Facey,\u201D she repeats softly. \u201CIt
    suits you.\u201D She takes another step forward, making the distance between
    you completely disappear. The faint scent of jasmine wraps tighter around you.
    Her eyes don\u2019t leave your mask.\n\nYou take a second to look at her more
    closely now, studying her in turn. She stands in front of you, smaller in stature,
    with an ease to her posture. Her dress flows with small folds, and her hair cascades
    down her back, with a few wavy locks framing her face. The thought comes uninvited\u2026
    and impossible to ignore. <i>\"She's... beautiful...\"</i>\n\nShe starts lifting
    her hand towards you until she reaches the edge of your mask.<color=#a674e8>\u201COh?\u201D</color>Eris
    hums, soft and curious now. <color=#a674e8>\u201CNow this is interesting\u2026\u201D</color>Eris
    walks towards you, watching, incredibly delighted. <color=#a674e8>\u201COh, little
    kitten...\u201D</color> she murmurs directly in your ear. <color=#a674e8>\u201CYou
    like what you see...?\u201D</color>You react instantly. Your hand quickly moves,
    grabbing her other wrist before she can fiddle with your mask any longer.\n\nHer
    composure slips for just a moment. You see the slight tension of her jaw, the
    way her breathing is not quite as steady and calm as before. She stands on the
    tip of her toes, closing the distance even more, whispering in your ear.\n\n\u201CYou
    shouldn\u2019t be here... not with him watching...\u201D\n\nA sharp knock at
    the door wakes you up from your thoughts. Serena tenses up and immediately steps
    back.\n\n\u201CYour Majesty?\u201D"
  importedSegments:
  - text: "Serena doesn\u2019t answer right away. Instead, she studies you for a
      second, leaning even closer.\n\n\u201C\u2026Facey,\u201D she repeats softly.
