      around you. Her eyes don\u2019t leave your mask.\n\nYou take a second to look
      at her more closely now, studying her in turn. She stands in front of you,
      smaller in stature, with an ease to her posture. Her dress flows with small
      folds, and her hair cascades down her back, with a few wavy locks framing her
      face. The thought comes uninvited\u2026 and impossible to ignore. <i>\"She's...
      beautiful...\"</i>\n\nShe starts lifting her hand towards you until she reaches
      the edge of your mask."
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "<color=#a674e8>\u201COh?\u201D</color>Eris hums, soft and curious now.
      <color=#a674e8>\u201CNow this is interesting\u2026\u201D</color>"
    condition:
      tokens:
      - tokenType: 0
        condition:
          mode: 2
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2b5c5b2a4f8c4d219da0eec43e8017c, type: 2}
          comparison: 0
          booleanValue: 0
          integerValue: 2
          floatValue: 2
          stringValue: 2
          invert: 0
