--- !u!114 &1723635343297900989
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Catacombs_IchorA
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: catacombs_ichora_line
  editorPosition: {x: 1955, y: 5625}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You hear the doors creak. You open your eyes and look down the hall. The
    guards shift slightly as the doors open, straightening immediately and bowing
    their heads.\n\nA figure emerges, stepping up from beyond the doors. He is tall
    and slender. His posture is straight; dark garments fall along his frame, high
    collar and long, straight silver hair. He walks forward, and as he does, a smaller
    figure is revealed beside him.\n\nYou turn to look and see him.\n\nA boy. Pale,
    small, thin, and\u2026 very still. Looking at you. His crystalline eyes hold
    yours, not blinking for a moment. You can\u2019t take your eyes off him. He doesn\u2019t
    move, just stands there. After a few seconds, he smiles.\n\nYour chest tightens.\n\n\u201CIchor,\u201D
    a voice calls. \u201CFollow.\u201D The figure continues forward, leading the
    boy down the corridor and out of view.\n\nOne of the guards exhales. The other
    places a hand on his shoulder. \u201CThis is part of the process\u2026 it will
    be over soon.\u201D"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: catacombs_ichora_choices_1
