--- !u!114 &3996569208941277726
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Catacombs_Go
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: catacombs_go_line
  editorPosition: {x: 3275, y: 4910}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "After a few minutes, one of them exhales sharply. \u201CStay here,\u201D
    he says. The other doesn\u2019t respond. The first guard turns and walks away
    down the corridor, his footsteps echoing along the hallway.\n\nThe second remains
    alone and continues his patrol. Your eyes follow his pattern closely, counting
    the steps. There. A gap...\n\nYou can move now, but is it worth it?"
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: catacombs_go_choices_1
--- !u!114 &4055618476282566204
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Shrine2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: shrine2_line
  editorPosition: {x: 3715, y: 4250}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You move away from the door quickly, pushing yourself through the room just
    as the door begins to open and footsteps enter.\n\nYou can't look back now, but
    you stay a little longer. This place mustn't be accessible to everyone, right?
    Then who...?\n\n<color=#E5200F>\u201CNyx, eternal goddess of the night\u2026
    your intuition was accurate...\u201D</color> A pause. <color=#E5200F>\u201CThey
    adapt more swiftly if we begin the process in younger subjects.\u201D</color>\n\nYou
    stay where you are, not moving a muscle, but listening.\n\n<color=#E5200F>\u201CNo,
    not all of them.\u201D</color> The voice takes a longer pause before continuing...
    but who is he talking to?\n\n<color=#E5200F>\u201CThat is not where the problem
    lies... They do not break... they simply do not retain it. After a few weeks,
    it is lost.\u201D</color> Silence. <color=#E5200F>\u201C\u2026understood. It
    shall be adjusted.\u201D</color>\n\nYou have stayed longer than you should. It's
    time to move."
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: shrine2_choices_1
--- !u!114 &4329941111093471605
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Strawberry_Talk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: strawberry_talk_line
  editorPosition: {x: 855, y: 1060}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "At this point, Strawberry has gotten used to your visits, so she doesn\u2019t
    react to your presence. She is just sitting with the animal, petting it and singing
    to it. And it just <i>leans</i> into it.\n\nThat is not right. Everything reacts
    to control or to fear. Or pain. This creature must have been conditioned somehow
    to react like this... right?<color=#a674e8>\u201CWould you look at that disgusting
    picture.\u201D</color> She sounds amused this time... <color=#a674e8>\u201CThat
    thing is going to kill you all if you let your guard down.\u201D</color> Your
    fingers twitch slightly at your side. There has to be something you have not
    seen yet. This can't be all.You take a slow breath in. The creature just sits
    next to Strawberry without any restraint. No visible injuries, so she's not being
    struck. It doesn't seem to be afraid of Strawberry either. That makes no sense.Strawberry
    finally looks up at you."
  importedSegments:
