      singing to it. And it just <i>leans</i> into it.\n\nThat is not right. Everything
      reacts to control or to fear. Or pain. This creature must have been conditioned
      somehow to react like this... right?"
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "<color=#a674e8>\u201CWould you look at that disgusting picture.\u201D</color>
