  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serena_Study
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: serena_study_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 7000}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Serena says nothing, but her eyes remain on you, studying you.You can kind
    of make out a shadow approaching you rapidly. The headache is impossible to handle
    anymore...\n\n\u201CYou \u0104\u0105\u0106\u0107\u0108\u0109\u010A yo\u0133\u0134\u0135
    much \u0188\u0454\u02B3\u1D57\u1D43\u1DA6\u1DB0\u1D57\u02B8 for an \u1DA6\u1DB0\u1D57\u02B3\u1D58\u1D48\u0454\u02B3\u201D\n\nYou
    blink once, and the shadow is now next to you. Too close.Serena looks at you,
    and the faintest lift at the corner of her lips forms. Serena begins to close
    the distance between you. The candlelight catches in her eyes as she studies
    you more closely now. <color=#FF675E>\u201CYou are... unusual... very interesting.\u201D</color>Serena
    begins to close the distance between you. <color=#FF675E>\u201CYou carry yourself
    with too much structure for an intruder,\u201D</color> she says. <color=#FF675E>\u201CUnusual.\u201D</color>
    She walks toward you slowly, until the space between you tightens. Why does her
    presence feel so... <i>soothing?</i>\n\n<color=#FF675E>\u201CSo, answer me straight.\u201D</color>
    She says as she starts turning to face you. <color=#FF675E>\u201CWho are you,
    and what are you searching for?\u201D</color>You scoff, and before she can react,
    step into the room and grab her wrist. \u201CNo,\u201D you say, holding her tighter,
    \u201CI\u2019m not here to play your games.\u201D"
  importedSegments:
  - text: Serena says nothing, but her eyes remain on you, studying you.
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "You can kind of make out a shadow approaching you rapidly. The headache
      is impossible to handle anymore...\n\n\u201CYou \u0104\u0105\u0106\u0107\u0108\u0109\u010A
      yo\u0133\u0134\u0135 much \u0188\u0454\u02B3\u1D57\u1D43\u1DA6\u1DB0\u1D57\u02B8
      for an \u1DA6\u1DB0\u1D57\u02B3\u1D58\u1D48\u0454\u02B3\u201D\n\nYou blink
      once, and the shadow is now next to you. Too close."
