      moving quickly from wall to wall, from papers to books to markings, to scrolls.
      Too much.


      You hear voices outside the room, patrolling around. Shit,
      there''s no time and there are too many details.'
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "<color=#a674e8>\u201CPick something useful.\u201D</color> The voice slips
      in, pleased. <color=#a674e8>\u201COr don't. Keep wasting time.\u201D</color>"
