  id: berryend_line
  editorPosition: {x: 1075, y: 2435}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "There is nothing left to say here. You stand there for a moment longer,
    waiting for her to say anything. She just curls back into the same position as
    before. This has been pointless.There is nothing left to say here. Strawberry
    just turns her attention back to Blueberry, petting her again, not looking at
    you anymore.\n\nYou stand there for a moment longer, waiting for the creature
    to snap. Nothing\u2014but... there has to be something missing. There has to
    be something you are not seeing.After a few minutes, you finally turn away from
    them and make your way out of the prison wing."
