  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: 'You make your way towards the largest map on the wall and lean forward.
    You can barely make out anything marked. Are these routes?


    You try to make
    sense of these to no avail. They kind of look like black market spots?


    No
    wording to compare or make any sense of what you are looking at.<color=#a674e8>"Uh,
    they might know."</color> <color=#a674e8>"Shut up already!"</color> She laughs
    once more and then fades. Damn her, always.You hear movement outside the room.
    You gotta go deal with that immediately.'
