--- !u!114 &7295295906210526141
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: StrongholdExplore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: strongholdexplore_line
  editorPosition: {x: 3055, y: 2545}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You move through the inner halls of the stronghold, reaching the space that
    is only accessible to Archon Valerian. There are fewer soldiers. That means fewer
    eyes. You stand by the corridors that lead toward Valerian\u2019s chambers.<color=#a674e8>\u201CWhat
    are you doing here, little rat,\u201D</color> she cackles. <color=#a674e8>\u201C\u2026or
    maybe you should be here?\u201D</color>You slow your pace, letting your eyes
    observe the walls, the doors, the details around you.\n\nNothing stands out.
    Valerian likes everything clean and controlled... But you sometimes wonder if
    it is <i>too</i> controlled. You linger for a moment longer, then move on.\n\n<i>\u201CI
    should come back later\u201D</i>You slow your pace, letting your eyes observe
    the walls, the doors, the details around you. Something doesn't sit right with
    you.\n\nYou notice a small section of the wall. Everything looks the same. Same
    stone, same markings... but the alignment is off. You step closer as your fingers
    brush against it. You knock that section a bit.\n\n\u201CHollow?\u201D\n\nBehind
    it, you are able to hear scratches and low wails. You pull your hand back.As
    you are walking, a pressure rushes to you immediately. You can feel it before
    you can see anything. Voices? You take a step closer towards the door, and you
    can hear it clearly. You can't mistake the tone. Always stern.\n\n<i>\u201CValerian\u201D</i>\n\n<color=#199D7C>\u201C...they
    are incomplete,\u201D</color> he says. Silence, then another voice answers, quieter;
    you can't make out the words, but you know he's not alone.\n\n<color=#199D7C>\u201CThese
    are not the expected results. Not yet.\u201D</color>\n\nYou stop. Whatever Valerian
    is keeping behind these doors is not of your concern. The Emerald Order is just
    working for humanity. It has to."
  importedSegments:
  - text: "You move through the inner halls of the stronghold, reaching the space
      that is only accessible to Archon Valerian. There are fewer soldiers. That
      means fewer eyes. You stand by the corridors that lead toward Valerian\u2019s
      chambers."
