--- !u!114 &7830691893372511181
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: CatacombsA
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: catacombsa_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2175, y: 4910}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You move deeper into the castle until you reach a corridor that tightens,
    then opens into a section lined with thick stone doors that look older than anything
    around them. In front of them, two guards patrol the entrance.\n\nYou slip behind
    a nearby pillar, pressing yourself into the shadows, watching.\n\nTheir patrol
    is tighter than the others you\u2019ve seen tonight. They don\u2019t cross the
    corridor. They don\u2019t speak. They just circle the same space, back and forth,
    back and forth. Nothing to work with."
  importedSegments: []
  useImportedSegments: 0
  wordLimit: 60
  typewriterSpeed: 0
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  music: {fileID: 0}
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
  nextNodeId: catacombsa_choices_1
--- !u!114 &7845385252836073340
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serena_Desk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: serena_desk_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2175, y: 6450}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "The notebook is small, leather-bound, worn at the corners. It seems it is
    used a lot...You don't even take a second. If <i>The Queen</i> keeps notes, they
    must be of relevance. There may be something useful inside.\n\nYou slip the notebook
    into your clothes, quickly but carefully, not to disturb anything else on the
    desk.You open the notebook just enough to give it a quick glance. It feels almost
    disappointingly normal... just some quick sketches on several pages or some big
    lettering here and there.\n\n<i>Is she a damn teenager?</i> Flowers. Bits of
    machinery. Strange little designs of something mechanical. Some lines are harsh,
    more frantic. Some are scratched over. Others are unfinished.\n\n\u201CStranger,
    what are you searching for?\u201D"
  importedSegments:
  - text: The notebook is small, leather-bound, worn at the corners. It seems it
      is used a lot...
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: 'You don''t even take a second. If <i>The Queen</i> keeps notes, they must
      be of relevance. There may be something useful inside.


      You slip the
      notebook into your clothes, quickly but carefully, not to disturb anything
      else on the desk.'
