--- !u!114 &8871521724201818936
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serena_Vio
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: serena_vio_line
  editorPosition: {x: 3220, y: 7165}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "You don\u2019t let go, and more than that, your grip around her wrist tightens
    as you place your other hand on your blade.\n\nShe studies you again, looking
    at you from top to bottom, but still not pulling away.\n\n<color=#FF675E>\u201C\u2026So
    this is who you are,\u201D</color> she murmurs. Her jaw tightens, and she then
    scoffs. <color=#FF675E>\u201CVery well. Do you really think it's supposed to
    be 'fair'? For you? For me?\u201D</color> Her eyes flicker. <color=#FF675E>\u201CThe
    Gods set things in motion, and we don't get to choose.\u201D</color><color=#a674e8><i>\u201COh,
    those Gods!\u201D</i></color> Eris says, pleased. <color=#a674e8><i>\u201CHow
    fun, being the victim, labeling a leash.\u201D</i></color>From the edge of your
    vision, Eris leans against the wall, watching the two of you with open amusement.
    <color=#a674e8>\u201CCareful, babe,\u201D</color> she hums, tilting her head.
    <color=#a674e8>\u201CYou\u2019re squeezing too hard.\u201D</color>Serena shakes
    her head, as if waking from her own thoughts.\n\nSerena exhales very sharply,
    looking very tired. <color=#FF675E>\u201CI am doing what I can,\u201D</color>
    she continues, more exalted now, <color=#FF675E>\u201Cto make sure he doesn't...\u201D</color>
    You see her fingers twitching.\n\n<color=#FF675E>\u201CThey\u2019re not\u2026
    meant to survive this...\u201D</color> she adds, looking back at you, composing
    herself."
  importedSegments:
  - text: "You don\u2019t let go, and more than that, your grip around her wrist
      tightens as you place your other hand on your blade.\n\nShe studies you again,
      looking at you from top to bottom, but still not pulling away.\n\n<color=#FF675E>\u201C\u2026So
      this is who you are,\u201D</color> she murmurs. Her jaw tightens, and she then
      scoffs. <color=#FF675E>\u201CVery well. Do you really think it's supposed to
      be 'fair'? For you? For me?\u201D</color> Her eyes flicker. <color=#FF675E>\u201CThe
      Gods set things in motion, and we don't get to choose.\u201D</color>"
    condition:
      tokens: []
  - text: "<color=#a674e8><i>\u201COh, those Gods!\u201D</i></color> Eris says, pleased.
      <color=#a674e8><i>\u201CHow fun, being the victim, labeling a leash.\u201D</i></color>"
    condition:
      tokens:
      - tokenType: 0
        condition:
          mode: 2
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2b5c5b2a4f8c4d219da0eec43e8017c, type: 2}
          comparison: 3
          booleanValue: 0
          integerValue: 2
          floatValue: 2
          stringValue: 2
          invert: 0
      - tokenType: 0
        condition:
          mode: 2
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2b5c5b2a4f8c4d219da0eec43e8017c, type: 2}
          comparison: 4
          booleanValue: 0
          integerValue: 3
          floatValue: 3
          stringValue: 3
          invert: 0
      - tokenType: 1
        condition:
          mode: 0
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 0}
          comparison: 0
          booleanValue: 1
          integerValue: 0
          floatValue: 0
          stringValue: 
          invert: 0
  - text: "From the edge of your vision, Eris leans against the wall, watching the
      two of you with open amusement. <color=#a674e8>\u201CCareful, babe,\u201D</color>
      she hums, tilting her head. <color=#a674e8>\u201CYou\u2019re squeezing too
      hard.\u201D</color>"
    condition:
      tokens:
      - tokenType: 0
        condition:
          mode: 2
          flag: {fileID: 0}
          variable: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2b5c5b2a4f8c4d219da0eec43e8017c, type: 2}
          comparison: 3
          booleanValue: 0
          integerValue: 3
          floatValue: 3
          stringValue: 3
          invert: 0
  - text: "Serena shakes her head, as if waking from her own thoughts.\n\nSerena
      exhales very sharply, looking very tired. <color=#FF675E>\u201CI am doing what
      I can,\u201D</color> she continues, more exalted now, <color=#FF675E>\u201Cto
      make sure he doesn't...\u201D</color> You see her fingers twitching.\n\n<color=#FF675E>\u201CThey\u2019re
      not\u2026 meant to survive this...\u201D</color> she adds, looking back at
      you, composing herself."
    condition:
      tokens: []
