--- !u!114 &8963117418128728772
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b9e76000000000000000000000044, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serena_Final
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MissNibiru.Narrative::MissNibiru.Narrative.NarrativeLineNode
  id: serena_final_line
  editorPosition: {x: 2615, y: 8155}
  character: {fileID: 0}
  emotion: {fileID: 0}
  portraitSide: 0
  text: "Serena doesn\u2019t answer right away. Instead, she studies you, now even
    closer... and you are not willing to break that distance.\n\nHer eyes trace the
    shape of your mask. <color=#f4a6b8>\u201CYou carry a certain curiosity,\u201D</color>
    she says, almost to herself. You take a second to look at her more closely now,
    studying her in turn. She stands in front of you, smaller in stature, with an
    ease to her posture. Her tunic flows with small folds, and her hair cascades
    down her back, with a few wavy locks framing her face. The thought comes uninvited\u2026
    and impossible to ignore.\n\n<i>\"She's... beautiful...\"</i>\n\nYou lose your
    focus for a second, until you see by the corner of your eye how her other hand
    lifts, slowly. Is she reaching for a weapon?\n\nNo. For your mask.<color=#a674e8>\u201COh?\u201D</color>
    <color=#a674e8>Eris hums, soft and curious now.</color> <color=#a674e8>\u201CNow
    this is interesting\u2026\u201D</color><color=#a674e8>Eris walks towards you,
    watching, incredibly delighted.</color> <color=#a674e8>\u201COh, little kitten...\u201D</color>
    she murmurs directly in your ear. <color=#a674e8>\u201CYou like what you see...?\u201D</color>Serena's
    fingers are now hovering just by your mask, close enough. She then stops. <color=#f4a6b8>\u201C\u2026Who
    are you?\u201D</color> she asks again, but this time softer. A sharp knock at
    the door wakes you up from your thoughts. Serena tenses up and immediately steps
    back.\n\n<color=#E5200F>\u201CYour Majesty?\u201D</color>"
  importedSegments:
