      closer... and you are not willing to break that distance.\n\nHer eyes trace
      the shape of your mask. <color=#f4a6b8>\u201CYou carry a certain curiosity,\u201D</color>
      she says, almost to herself. You take a second to look at her more closely
      now, studying her in turn. She stands in front of you, smaller in stature,
      with an ease to her posture. Her tunic flows with small folds, and her hair
      cascades down her back, with a few wavy locks framing her face. The thought
      comes uninvited\u2026 and impossible to ignore.\n\n<i>\"She's... beautiful...\"</i>\n\nYou
      lose your focus for a second, until you see by the corner of your eye how her
      other hand lifts, slowly. Is she reaching for a weapon?\n\nNo. For your mask."
    condition:
      tokens: []
